WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.646
Farmer planted turnip seeds.

2
00:00:11.647 --> 00:00:15.094
He watered them every day.

3
00:00:15.095 --> 00:00:20.258
One turnip grew and grew and grew.

4
00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:28.443
Finally the enormous turnip was ready to eat.

5
00:00:28.444 --> 00:00:31.897
Farmer pulled.

6
00:00:31.898 --> 00:00:37.048
But it didn't move.

7
00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:40.450
"Wife!" called Farmer.

8
00:00:40.451 --> 00:00:43.992
"Help me pull this turnip!"

9
00:00:43.993 --> 00:00:53.316
His wife pulled too.

10
00:00:53.317 --> 00:00:57.225
But the turnip didn't move.

11
00:00:57.226 --> 00:01:00.822
A boy with a dog came over.

12
00:01:00.823 --> 00:01:05.810
"My dog and I can help," he said.

13
00:01:05.811 --> 00:01:15.483
They all pulled.

14
00:01:15.484 --> 00:01:21.847
But the turnip still didn’t move.

15
00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.989
Then a cat came along.

16
00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:28.399
Everyone pulled together.

17
00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:33.275
The turnip moved . . . a little.

18
00:01:33.276 --> 00:01:38.336
Finally Farmer sighed.

19
00:01:38.337 --> 00:01:49.699
"This turnip is too big. I give up."

20
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:53.824
"I can help!" said a mouse.

21
00:01:53.825 --> 00:01:57.151
Everyone laughed.

22
00:01:57.152 --> 00:02:01.752
"This is an enormous turnip!" said Farmer.

23
00:02:01.753 --> 00:02:05.723
"You're just a little mouse!"

24
00:02:05.724 --> 00:02:09.313
But Farmer let Mouse help.

25
00:02:09.314 --> 00:02:12.316
"Ready?" said Farmer.

26
00:02:12.317 --> 00:02:15.709
"Ready!" said everyone.

27
00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:21.680
Together they pulled.

28
00:02:21.681 --> 00:02:25.407
Suddenly . . . Pop!

29
00:02:25.408 --> 00:02:30.477
Out came the turnip!

30
00:02:30.478 --> 00:02:34.100
"We did it!" cried Mouse.

31
00:02:34.101 --> 00:02:38.214
"We all worked together," said Farmer.

32
00:02:38.215 --> 00:02:46.789
"Whew! Next year I'll plant pumpkins!"

